  "definition": {
    "scale_info": {
      "name": "Reflective Functioning Questionnaire – 18 items (Self/Other)",
      "code": "RFQ-18",
      "abbreviation": "RFQ-18",
      "description": "18-item RFQ with Self-RF (9 items) and Other-RF (9 items) subscales (supplemental S1 to PLoS ONE pone.0259030). Items drawn from the RFQ-54. 7-point.",
      "citation": "RFQ-18 self/other subscales, supplemental S1 to https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0259030 ; Fonagy et al. (2016), PLoS ONE 11(7): e0158678.",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0",
      "license_explanation": "RFQ items reproduced from the PLoS ONE open-access article (CC BY 4.0, pone.0259030) and its supplemental S1 Text ('RFQ18 self and other subscale items from RFQ54'). With attribution.",
      "license_url": "https://journals.plos.org/plosone/article?id=10.1371/journal.pone.0259030",
      "url": "https://www.ucl.ac.uk/psychoanalysis/research/reflective-functioning-questionnaire-rfq",
      "domain": "Clinical",
      "version": "1.0"
    },
    "implementation": {
      "author": "Shane T. Mueller",
      "organization": "OpenScales Project",
      "date": "2026-06-17",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
      "notes": "RFQ-18 self/other version. Self items = RFQ-54 #8,12,16,20,28,35,40,45,46; Other items = #1,2,6,7,14,18,26,27,38 (per pone.0259030 S1 Text). NOTE: S1 has a copy-typo (self item 8 shows item 7's text); used verbatim RFQ-54 item 8 ('I always know what I feel'). SCORING PLACEHOLDER: Self-RF and Other-RF as means of raw responses — the validated recode/reverse-coding for the self/other subscales is in the article body, not S1; VERIFY and update. EN from RFQ_54.docx; KO from UCL Korean RFQ (54). CC BY via PLoS. SCORING STATUS (investigated 2026-06-17): the self/other subscales = Moulton-Perkins's Internal-Self / Internal-Other (Rogoff et al. 2021, pone.0259030 cites these). The validated recode/keying is only in Moulton-Perkins et al. (2011), an UNPUBLISHED conference presentation (BPS Clinical/SPR, May 2011) — no DOI; not in the supplements or the RFQ-R-7 paper (pone.0282000). The pre-validated RFQ-54 reportedly used a 'mixed polar and median-scored' system, distinct from the RFQ-8 polar recode. Placeholder mean retained pending an authoritative source."
    },
